    h1 Index
    h2 About the Index
    text This page includes a list of all ARIA design pattern examples indexed either by role or by ARIA properties and states.
    link "Examples by Role" #examples_by_role_label
    link "Examples by Properties and States" #examples_by_props_label
    link "Experimental Examples" #examples_experimental_label
    h2 Examples by Role
    text NOTE: The HC abbreviation means example has High Contrast support.
    table Role Examples
      alert | Alert Alert Dialog
      alertdialog | Alert Dialog
      article | Disclosure (Show/Hide) Card (HC) Infinite Scrolling Feed
      banner | Navigation Menubar (HC) Navigation Treeview (HC) Banner Landmark
      button | Button (IDL Version) Button
      cell | Table
      checkbox | Checkbox (Mixed-State) (HC) Checkbox (Two State) (HC)
      columnheader | Table
      combobox | Editable Combobox With Both List and Inline Autocomplete (HC) Editable Combobox With List Autocomplete (HC) Editable Combobox without Autocomplete (HC) Date Picker Combobox (HC) Select-Only Combobox Editable Combobox with Grid Popup
