      aria-activedescendant | Editable Combobox With Both List and Inline Autocomplete (HC) Editable Combobox With List Autocomplete (HC) Editable Combobox without Autocomplete (HC) Select-Only Combobox Editable Combobox with Grid Popup (Deprecated) Collapsible Dropdown Listbox Listbox with Grouped Options Listboxes with Rearrangeable Options Scrollable Listbox Actions Menu Button Using aria-activedescendant (HC) Radio Group Using aria-activedescendant (HC)
