      aria-label | Breadcrumb Auto-Rotating Image Carousel with Buttons for Slide Control Auto-Rotating Image Carousel with Tabs for Slide Control (HC) Editable Combobox With Both List and Inline Autocomplete (HC) Editable Combobox With List Autocomplete (HC) Editable Combobox without Autocomplete (HC) Date Picker Combobox (HC) Date Picker Dialog (HC) Link Editor Menubar (HC) Navigation Menubar (HC) Rating Radio Group (HC) Horizontal Multi-Thumb Slider (HC) (Deprecated) Date Picker Spin Button Table Toolbar Treegrid Email Inbox Navigation Treeview (HC)
      aria-labelledby | Accordion Alert Dialog Checkbox (Two State) (HC) Date Picker Combobox (HC) Select-Only Combobox Editable Combobox with Grid Popup Date Picker Dialog (HC) Modal Dialog Infinite Scrolling Feed Data Grid Layout Grid (Deprecated) Collapsible Dropdown Listbox Listbox with Grouped Options Listboxes with Rearrangeable Options Scrollable Listbox Actions Menu Button Using aria-activedescendant (HC) Actions Menu Button Using element.focus() (HC) Navigation Menu Button (HC) Navigation Menubar (HC) Meter Radio Group Using aria-activedescendant (HC) Rating Radio Group (HC) Radio Group Using Roving tabindex (HC) Color Viewer Slider (HC) Rating Slider (HC) Media Seek Slider (HC) Vertical Temperature Slider (HC) (Deprecated) Date Picker Spin Button Switch Using HTML Button (HC) Tabs with Automatic Activation (HC) Tabs with Manual Activation (HC) File Directory Treeview Using Computed Properties File Directory Treeview Using Declared Properties Navigation Treeview (HC) Complementary Landmark Form Landmark Main Landmark Navigation Landmark Region Landmark Search Landmark
